<title>RUSSIA: Three die in Russian sports plane crash.</title>
<headline>Three die in Russian sports plane crash.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people on board a small sports plane were killed when it crashed in Russia's southern Oryol region, the Emergencies Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>A ministry spokesman said the plane had come down on Thursday in a deserted area and caused no damage. He did not say what had caused the crash.</p>
</text>
